+def image_file_limit() -> int:
+    """The most a local image file may hold, in bytes: 32 MiB, the same bound as an image URL (the web app attaches
+    pictures of up to 20 MB).  STRATA_MAX_IMAGE_FILE_MIB changes it (0 or an unreadable value: the default).  Checked
+    with os.path.getsize before the file is opened, so a 28 GB shard named .png is a 400 and never enters the server's
